{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Paripuṇṇaka","html":"<article id='thag1.91'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.91 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.91 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Ten </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Paripuṇṇakattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Paripuṇṇaka </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Na tathā mataṁ satarasaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>What I consumed today is considered better </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sudhannaṁ yaṁ mayajja paribhuttaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>than delicious grain of a hundred flavors—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Aparimitadassinā gotamena, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the Dhamma taught by the Buddha, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Buddhena desito dhammo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Gotama of infinite vision. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Paripuṇṇako thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
